flowchart TD
B --> C[Receive Standard Tandem Layout from Sales Agent]
C --> D[Fill-out & Sign Layout]
D --> E[Submit Layout + ₱200,000 cash/check bond → Sales Management]
E --> F[RTN forwarded to Construction-Division Accounting]
 F --> G[Acknowledgement Receipt (AR) issued]
 G --> H[Action Sheet prepared → Management Approval]
 H --> I[Construction proceeds → Wait until unit is ready for turnover]
 I --> J[Unit Inspection (Bring AR copy)]
 J --> K{Is Certificate of Acceptance issued?}
 K -- No --> I
 K -- Yes --> L[Fill-out Request to Release Construction Bond Form]
  L --> M[Forward Form + AR + Certificate of Acceptance → Treasury (Construction Division)]
   M --> N[Treasury processes release of construction bond]
    N --> O[Customer Care informs you when bond is ready for release]
     O --> P([End])
    